    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Teenage boy in a blue crew-neck tee, sand cargo shorts with flap pockets, white crew socks and chunky white-and-orange trainers. A high-resolution crop of the footwear confirms the orange elements are plain moulded panels with no logo, swoosh or wordmark. Garment hems are open rings with limbs inside, the cargo pockets are present on both legs, and the hair is closed from the top and back. Materials score 4 because the clothing is intentionally simple flat-shaded fabric with little surface variation. Rigged: 54-bone humanoid armature (24 body + 30 finger bones), walk and run clips, zero unweighted skinned vertices.",
